' ============================================================
' Known defects worth carrying on the diagram
' ============================================================
note as N1 #FFCDD2
  **BLOCKER - FID / UID mix-up**
  Engine::update() does
  ""fixs[fid]->Resolve(values)""
  but ""fixs"" is keyed by UID while
  ""Frame"" is keyed by FID.
  With startFID != startUID this
  default-inserts a null shared_ptr
  and segfaults.
  Fix: populate m_fixtureByFIDs and
  look fixtures up by FID.
end note
N1 .. Engine

note as N2 #FFE0B2
  **Effect editing needs addressing**
  EffectWrapper has no id, so nothing
  can reach setBpm()/setCurve() on a
  running effect. Programmer throws the
  pushRet() handle away.
end note
N2 .. EffectGroup

note as N3 #FFE0B2
  **Static edits are not idempotent**
  Programmer::setColor() pushes a NEW
  StaticColor every call instead of
  updating the existing one for that
  (selection, category).
end note
N3 .. Programmer

note as N4 #FFE0B2
  **Missing repatch path**
  Changing a fixture's universe must go
  through patch() so setBuffer() is
  re-pointed; setStart() alone leaves it
  writing into the old universe buffer.
end note
N4 .. Patch

@enduml
